Overview:
This project uses Artificial Intelligence and Deep Learning to generate new music sequences from MIDI music data using an LSTM (Long Short-Term Memory) neural network.

Features:
-->Collect and preprocess MIDI music data.
-->Convert musical notes into numerical sequences.
-->Train an LSTM model to learn musical patterns.
-->Generate new music sequences using the trained model.
-->Save the generated music as MIDI files

Using:
Music21: A Python library used to analyze, process, and manipulate musical notes and MIDI files.
MIDI Utilities: Python tools used to create, edit, and save MIDI music files.
